WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:45.208
In verses 13.14

2
00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:48.458
and 13.15, Lord Krishna

3
00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:50.416
continues His description of the jneya,

4
00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:53.166
the object of knowledge.

5
00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:55.791
Here He focuses on the Paramatma,

6
00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.166
the Supreme Soul, who dwells within all living beings

7
00:00:58.166 --> 00:01:01.041
and pervades the entire universe.

8
00:01:01.041 --> 00:01:01.708
Lord Krishna

9
00:01:01.708 --> 00:01:03.291
reveals the all-pervading

10
00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:05.458
nature of the Paramatma

11
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:06.875
and distinguishes Him from the jivatma,

12
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:10.750
the individual soul.

13
00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.875
The jivatma is limited to a particular place,

14
00:01:13.875 --> 00:01:17.833
but the Paramatma is omnipresent
and all-knowing.

15
00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.833
He is the supreme source

16
00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:22.333
and sustainer of all.

17
00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:28.250
Sarvatah pani

18
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:32.000
padam tat, everywhere are His hands

19
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:33.750
and feet.

20
00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.416
This verse describes the all-pervading

21
00:01:36.416 --> 00:01:38.333
nature of the Paramatma.

22
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:41.916
His hands and feet are spread everywhere.

23
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:44.250
This shows that He is present in all the

24
00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.500
activities

25
00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.000
and operations of the universe.

26
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.416
Even from a distance,

27
00:01:50.416 --> 00:01:52.416
He accepts the offerings of His devotees.

28
00:01:52.416 --> 00:01:55.250
This shows that distance and
physical limitations

29
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.541
do not affect

30
00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:59.125
His ability to act.

31
00:01:59.125 --> 00:02:03.916
This is described in Bhagavad Gita
Chapter 9, verse 26,

32
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:06.166
where Lord Krishna says,

33
00:02:06.166 --> 00:02:06.916
'If someone offers

34
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:10.875
Me with love and devotion a leaf, a flower,

35
00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:11.625
a fruit, or

36
00:02:11.625 --> 00:02:13.666
water,

37
00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:17.333
I will accept it.'

38
00:02:17.333 --> 00:02:20.000
“Sarvatah akshi shirah mukham”,

39
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.541
everywhere are His eyes,

40
00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:24.875
head, and face.

41
00:02:24.875 --> 00:02:26.916
The Paramatma sees everything,

42
00:02:26.916 --> 00:02:31.083
past, present, and future.

43
00:02:31.083 --> 00:02:34.000
Eyes everywhere means He is the witness

44
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.125
of all activities, desires,

45
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.125
and intentions of every being.

46
00:02:38.125 --> 00:02:41.791
Nothing remains hidden from His sight.

47
00:02:41.791 --> 00:02:44.000
Head and face everywhere,

48
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.791
this emphasises

49
00:02:45.791 --> 00:02:47.583
that He is the source of all knowledge

50
00:02:47.583 --> 00:02:50.000
and awareness.

51
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.541
He manifests His intelligence

52
00:02:51.541 --> 00:02:54.708
through all living beings.

53
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:57.541
“Sarvatah shrutimat loke”,

54
00:02:57.541 --> 00:03:00.166
His ears are everywhere.

55
00:03:00.166 --> 00:03:02.166
This means that the Paramatma

56
00:03:02.166 --> 00:03:03.958
hears every sound, prayer,

57
00:03:03.958 --> 00:03:05.833
and thought.

58
00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:07.208
This shows that

59
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:11.166
He is the complete witness of all activities.

60
00:03:11.166 --> 00:03:15.291
Even the most silent and unspoken prayers

61
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:19.708
of the heart He hears.

62
00:03:19.708 --> 00:03:22.208
“Sarvam avritya tishthati”,

63
00:03:22.208 --> 00:03:25.791
He stands pervading everything.

64
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:28.500
The Paramatma pervades all of creation.

65
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:30.750
Whatever comes to pass,

66
00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:32.958
He both manages it

67
00:03:32.958 --> 00:03:36.250
and witnesses it.

68
00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.333
While the jivatma is confined to one body,

69
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:40.333
the Paramatma

70
00:03:40.333 --> 00:03:41.625
pervades all bodies

71
00:03:41.625 --> 00:03:44.666
and all existence.

72
00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:47.000
This verse emphasises that

73
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.125
the Paramatma is the indwelling Supreme,

74
00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:51.000
who observes and manages

75
00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.583
the universe,

76
00:03:52.583 --> 00:03:54.083
and if something is needed,

77
00:03:54.083 --> 00:03:56.083
provides it too.

78
00:03:56.083 --> 00:03:59.250
Just as the sun spreads its light everywhere

79
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.416
and illuminates all things,

80
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:02.625
the Paramatma

81
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:03.708
spreads His consciousness

82
00:04:03.708 --> 00:04:06.416
throughout the universe.

83
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:09.833
Although the sun appears in one place,

84
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:13.083
its rays pervade the entire solar system.

85
00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:16.083
In the same way, the light of the
Paramatma's divinity

86
00:04:16.083 --> 00:04:19.333
illuminates the hearts of all beings

87
00:04:19.333 --> 00:04:23.583
and pervades the entire universe.

88
00:04:23.583 --> 00:04:26.833
“Sarvendriyas guna abhasam”,

89
00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:30.541
the source of all senses and their objects.

90
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:33.041
The Paramatma is the source of all senses

91
00:04:33.041 --> 00:04:34.125
and their

92
00:04:34.125 --> 00:04:36.916
activities.

93
00:04:36.916 --> 00:04:40.500
All functions of the senses, seeing, hearing,

94
00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.041
tasting, smelling,

95
00:04:42.041 --> 00:04:43.375
and touching,

96
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:45.916
exist because of His power.

97
00:04:45.916 --> 00:04:47.083
He gives the jivatma

98
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:50.166
the ability to understand and interact
with the world

99
00:04:50.166 --> 00:04:55.333
through these senses.

100
00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:57.083
“Sarvendriyas vivarjitam”,

101
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.416
yet free from all material senses.

102
00:05:00.416 --> 00:05:01.583
Although the Paramatma

103
00:05:01.583 --> 00:05:05.208
is the source of all sense activities.

104
00:05:05.208 --> 00:05:07.250
He remains beyond the limitations

105
00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.791
of material senses.

106
00:05:08.791 --> 00:05:10.083
His divine senses

107
00:05:10.083 --> 00:05:11.541
enable Him to function

108
00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:12.833
without needing

109
00:05:12.833 --> 00:05:15.666
material senses.

110
00:05:15.666 --> 00:05:19.291
“Asaktam sarvabhrit ca eva”,

111
00:05:19.291 --> 00:05:20.666
means - he is unattached,

112
00:05:20.666 --> 00:05:23.833
yet the sustainer of all.

113
00:05:23.833 --> 00:05:25.166
The Paramatma nourishes and sustains

114
00:05:25.166 --> 00:05:28.708
all living beings and the universe,

115
00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:32.541
yet remains detached from the outcomes.

116
00:05:32.541 --> 00:05:35.708
One example can be of the sun,

117
00:05:35.708 --> 00:05:38.750
which nourishes all life on earth

118
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.500
but is not affected by the
activities of living beings,

119
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:47.625
In the same way, the Paramatma
supports and maintains

120
00:05:47.625 --> 00:05:49.541
yet remains unattached

121
00:05:49.541 --> 00:05:53.750
and unaffected by material results.

122
00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.083
“Nirgunam guna bhoktri ca”,

123
00:05:56.083 --> 00:05:58.291
beyond the gunas,

124
00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:01.750
yet the master of all gunas.

125
00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:03.416
The Paramatma is nirguna,

126
00:06:03.416 --> 00:06:06.708
beyond the three gunas of prakriti.

127
00:06:06.708 --> 00:06:07.458
Yet

128
00:06:07.458 --> 00:06:09.541
He controls the interactions

129
00:06:09.541 --> 00:06:11.708
of these gunas.

130
00:06:11.708 --> 00:06:14.458
He is the guna-bhoktri, the master

131
00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:17.458
of sattva, rajas,

132
00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:20.916
and tamas.

133
00:06:20.916 --> 00:06:22.000
He uses them

134
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.375
for the maintenance of material creation.

135
00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:26.583
Though the Paramatma

136
00:06:26.583 --> 00:06:27.958
controls the gunas

137
00:06:27.958 --> 00:06:29.500
of material nature,

138
00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:32.791
He remains unaffected by them.

139
00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:34.458
This is like a king

140
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:36.708
who governs his kingdom

141
00:06:36.708 --> 00:06:38.500
but does not personally become entangled

142
00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:41.208
in its daily affairs.

143
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:42.958
In these verses, Lord Krishna

144
00:06:42.958 --> 00:06:45.291
reveals the glory of the Paramatma,

145
00:06:45.291 --> 00:06:49.375
the all-pervading witness, the source
of all sense functions,

146
00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:51.875
and the sustainer of the universe, who

147
00:06:51.875 --> 00:06:55.250
remains unaffected by material entanglements.

148
00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.958
When a person understands the
Paramatma's omnipresence

149
00:06:57.958 --> 00:07:00.000
and omniscience,

150
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.250
it helps them develop devotion, detachment,

151
00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.375
and reverence toward the Supreme.

152
00:07:11.791 --> 00:07:13.708
Reflect on this,

153
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:16.833
what stops most people from living

154
00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:20.833
with integrity?

155
00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:23.833
One thought,

156
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:26.125
'no one is watching.'

157
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:28.708
And this one thought gives birth

158
00:07:28.708 --> 00:07:32.125
to a thousand excuses.

159
00:07:32.125 --> 00:07:34.666
You tell yourself,

160
00:07:34.666 --> 00:07:38.000
it is just a small lie,

161
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:40.750
a harmless shortcut,

162
00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.125
or a moment of weakness

163
00:07:43.125 --> 00:07:46.333
that no one will see.

164
00:07:46.333 --> 00:07:49.250
But think,

165
00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.041
am I not watching?

166
00:07:51.041 --> 00:07:53.333
As the Paramatma,

167
00:07:53.333 --> 00:07:56.041
I am seated in your heart.

168
00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:58.375
I see every action,

169
00:07:58.375 --> 00:08:00.416
hear every word,

170
00:08:00.416 --> 00:08:03.666
and know even the thoughts that

171
00:08:03.666 --> 00:08:06.916
never reach your lips.

172
00:08:06.916 --> 00:08:11.000
Nothing is hidden from Me,

173
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:14.000
not your struggles, not your intentions,

174
00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:17.458
and yes, not your excuses either.

175
00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:18.416
But I am

176
00:08:18.416 --> 00:08:22.333
not merely a silent witness.

177
00:08:22.333 --> 00:08:26.416
I am also your greatest ally.

178
00:08:26.416 --> 00:08:29.416
If you call out to Me,

179
00:08:29.416 --> 00:08:33.166
I can give you the strength to say no when

180
00:08:33.166 --> 00:08:38.375
temptation stands before you,

181
00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:39.666
when lower impulses

182
00:08:39.666 --> 00:08:42.833
try to pull you down.

183
00:08:42.833 --> 00:08:45.458
You do not need to rely

184
00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:48.833
on willpower alone,

185
00:08:48.833 --> 00:08:53.416
I am always with you.

186
00:08:53.416 --> 00:08:56.333
When you live knowing

187
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:59.458
that I am watching over you,

188
00:08:59.458 --> 00:09:02.750
not as a judge or a critic,

189
00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:06.833
but as a loving guide,

190
00:09:06.833 --> 00:09:11.000
you rise above your weaknesses.

191
00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.583
You choose what is better,

192
00:09:14.583 --> 00:09:17.333
not out of fear,

193
00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:19.541
but out of love and respect

194
00:09:19.541 --> 00:09:23.250
for your true self.

195
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.500
This awareness becomes the
foundation of a strong,

196
00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:33.083
purposeful, and deeply peaceful life.

197
00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:41.541
When a child in the family hides something,

198
00:09:41.541 --> 00:09:45.000
or someone close to you

199
00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:48.833
does something wrong behind your back,
what do you do?

200
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:51.541
Most people feel hurt

201
00:09:51.541 --> 00:09:54.666
or betrayed.

202
00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:58.166
And their natural response is

203
00:09:58.166 --> 00:09:59.541
to get angry,

204
00:09:59.541 --> 00:10:02.833
criticise them, or make them

205
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:04.916
feel guilty.

206
00:10:04.916 --> 00:10:06.875
But

207
00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:10.625
is this the only way to respond?

208
00:10:10.625 --> 00:10:13.125
As the Paramatma,

209
00:10:13.125 --> 00:10:16.333
I am seated in every heart.

210
00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:20.125
I know everyone's weaknesses,

211
00:10:20.125 --> 00:10:23.583
but I also know their strengths

212
00:10:23.583 --> 00:10:26.000
and their potential.

213
00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.333
I am not quick to punish.

214
00:10:30.333 --> 00:10:32.166
I wait patiently

215
00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:33.916
for the spark of truth

216
00:10:33.916 --> 00:10:37.000
within them to shine.

217
00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:39.875
I encourage,

218
00:10:39.875 --> 00:10:42.500
guide,

219
00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:45.625
and lift them up.

220
00:10:45.625 --> 00:10:48.916
And this is the role I wish

221
00:10:48.916 --> 00:10:50.500
you to play as an elder

222
00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:53.625
in your family.

223
00:10:53.625 --> 00:10:55.791
Do not become someone

224
00:10:55.791 --> 00:10:58.833
who is always trying to catch others

225
00:10:58.833 --> 00:11:01.833
doing wrong.

226
00:11:01.833 --> 00:11:05.833
Be someone who sees them doing right

227
00:11:05.833 --> 00:11:09.875
and helps them move forward.

228
00:11:09.875 --> 00:11:13.000
Correct them with compassion,

229
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.166
not humiliation.

230
00:11:15.166 --> 00:11:19.958
Speak to them in a way that makes
them want to improve,

231
00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:22.083
not hide.

232
00:11:22.083 --> 00:11:23.583
When family members

233
00:11:23.583 --> 00:11:27.583
understand that they can speak
honestly even when they are wrong

234
00:11:27.583 --> 00:11:31.000
and still be safe,

235
00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.916
they move forward with confidence.

236
00:11:34.916 --> 00:11:38.458
And when you respond as I do,

237
00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:42.541
seeing the soul behind every action,

238
00:11:42.541 --> 00:11:46.541
you do not merely correct a mistake.

239
00:11:46.541 --> 00:11:49.083
You strengthen the bond

240
00:11:49.083 --> 00:11:52.458
and awaken a trust

241
00:11:52.458 --> 00:11:54.916
that lasts a lifetime.

242
00:11:59.291 --> 00:12:00.791
At the workplace,

243
00:12:00.791 --> 00:12:03.583
small compromises are easy to make,

244
00:12:03.583 --> 00:12:07.375
cutting corners in a report,

245
00:12:07.375 --> 00:12:09.166
hiding a mistake,

246
00:12:09.166 --> 00:12:11.125
taking credit for something you did not do.

247
00:12:11.125 --> 00:12:15.541
And the mind quietly whispers,

248
00:12:15.541 --> 00:12:18.791
'No one will know.'

249
00:12:18.791 --> 00:12:23.083
But I am the Paramatma,

250
00:12:23.083 --> 00:12:26.208
seated in every heart,

251
00:12:26.208 --> 00:12:29.750
watching silently,

252
00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:32.708
not to catch you,

253
00:12:32.708 --> 00:12:36.250
but to guide you.

254
00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:38.166
Integrity is not about

255
00:12:38.166 --> 00:12:41.083
what others see.

256
00:12:41.083 --> 00:12:44.000
It is about what you know

257
00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:48.208
deep within yourself.

258
00:12:48.208 --> 00:12:51.916
You can hide things from
your manager, your team,

259
00:12:51.916 --> 00:12:57.750
even your closest colleague,

260
00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.375
but can you

261
00:12:59.375 --> 00:13:04.500
hide it from yourself?

262
00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.958
From Me?

263
00:13:06.958 --> 00:13:11.750
I am the witness not only of your actions

264
00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:15.250
but of your intentions.

265
00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:19.333
And when you struggle to do the right thing,

266
00:13:19.333 --> 00:13:22.958
do not think you are alone.

267
00:13:22.958 --> 00:13:25.291
Call out to Me,

268
00:13:25.291 --> 00:13:28.125
I can give you the strength

269
00:13:28.125 --> 00:13:33.083
to remain honest, calm, and clear,

270
00:13:33.083 --> 00:13:36.791
even when no one else is watching.

271
00:13:36.791 --> 00:13:39.708
True growth

272
00:13:39.708 --> 00:13:43.250
does not come only from promotion or praise.

273
00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:44.750
It comes when you

274
00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:48.791
walk through challenges with your head held high

275
00:13:48.791 --> 00:13:52.291
and your heart clean.

276
00:13:52.291 --> 00:13:54.833
Believe in being truly honest,

277
00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:58.333
not merely appearing so.

278
00:13:58.333 --> 00:14:01.708
Then watch, everything

279
00:14:01.708 --> 00:14:04.375
in life will begin to move toward the good.
